  "contract": "Reproduction of an in-game report: a level 53 Witch Doctor knowing Hex of Malice ranks 1-7 (801693, 501153-501158) with ranks 7, 6 and 5 on the bar. Umbral Glaive's proc 504588 swapped all three buttons; after casting Umbral Glaive one button showed the hidden spell 22050 that the swap's end used to replace Umbral Glaive with through SMSG_SUPERCEDED_SPELL, which rewrites every client button holding the old spell. Expected: every button returns to its own rank on both the client and the server, no SMSG_SUPERCEDED_SPELL is sent, Umbral Glaive stays in the spellbook and casting it without the proc is refused.",
